            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Wadi El Gamal National Park Safari offers a private and customizable trip, providing a unique opportunity to explore one of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000003"
              ],
              "text": "Egypt’s"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " most fascinating natural and historical sites. Here’s a typical itinerary for a half-day safari from your hotel:"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Egypt",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Exploring the Valley"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ":"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The safari begins with a journey through the Wadi El Gamal Valley, known for its diverse ecosystems."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "You’ll witness the beauty of mangrove forests and acacia trees, which are integral to the local ecology."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Historical Sites"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ":"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A visit to the ancient emerald mines is a highlight, offering a glimpse into Egypt’s rich mining history."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The tour also includes exploring an ancient Egyptian temple from the Roman period, adding a historical dimension to your adventure."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Lunch and Refreshments"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ":"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The trip typically includes lunch, along with tea and soft drinks. The meals offer a chance to relax and refuel in the midst of nature."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000018",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Swimming at Gullan Bay"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ":"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "After touring the valley and historical sites, you’ll have the opportunity to enjoy a refreshing swim at Gullan Bay. It’s a perfect way to cool off and enjoy the stunning Red Sea waters."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Customizable Experience"
