              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "This safari is not just a journey through a natural reserve, but also a deep dive into the historical and ecological treasures of Egypt. It’s an ideal excursion for those looking to combine adventure with cultural and historical exploration in one of Egypt’s most beautiful national parks."
            }
